# .claude/audit-trails-green/ — session transcripts (JSONL) that passed /chain_audit
# with verdict GREEN and got user approval during the interactive audit.
#
# Moved here from ~/.claude/projects/c--Users-rutvi-projects-encore-framework/*.jsonl
# so that folder stays lean — fewer transcripts for future /chain_audit runs to
# scan when hunting for the one associated with a plan.
#
# Plan files stay in plans/done/ (unchanged). Only the *transcripts* (audit trails)
# move here. YELLOW/RED transcripts stay at the source until user resolves and
# re-audits → GREEN → then they move.
#
# claude --resume <uuid> will NO LONGER work on moved transcripts (the desktop
# app and --resume index only the source folder). That's intentional — moved
# = "signed off, no longer needs interactive replay."
